<section class="chk">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready to talk to a bankruptcy lawyer?</h2>
    <div class="seg">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="tag">Outside Colorado</p>
        <h3>Search the NACBA directory</h3>
        <p>The National Association of Consumer Bankruptcy Attorneys (NACBA) is a national professional association dedicated to supporting consumer bankruptcy lawyers and protecting the rights of people facing bankruptcy. Its member directory is a good starting point for finding a lawyer in your area.</p>
        <p>Use the &ldquo;Postal Code&rdquo; search at the top of the page: enter your ZIP code, choose a distance (such as 50 miles), and run the search.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://network.nacba.org/network/advanced-search" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find a lawyer near you &rarr;</a>
        <p class="fine">Opens NACBA&rsquo;s website. The directory is maintained by NACBA and may not include every bankruptcy lawyer in your area. Membership does not guarantee the quality of an attorney&rsquo;s services, and GoBK does not screen or endorse individual attorneys.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="tag">In Colorado</p>
        <h3>Talk with a Colorado bankruptcy firm</h3>
        <p>GoBK was founded by Matt McCune, a Colorado consumer bankruptcy attorney. If you live in Colorado, you can reach his firm, McCune Legal, directly, or use the NACBA directory to compare Colorado lawyers.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://mccunelegal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact McCune Legal &rarr;</a>
        <p class="fine"><strong>Disclosure:</strong> McCune Legal funds GoBK. Contacting the firm is entirely optional, and you are free to hire any lawyer. GoBK does not screen or endorse individual attorneys.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
